// The Coax project's work seeds, checked offline before they are published:
//
//   openagents project plan-rules
//
// Every work file of apps/openagents-web/projects/coax/work reads and passes
// work_check (unique slugs, known parents and blockers, no cycles), and the
// items fit the page (MAX_ITEMS in apps/openagents-web/project.coax). In the
// coax-nostr seed, every task names its files and its acceptance, comes after
// its blockers, and lists as blocks exactly the tasks it blocks. Then the
// plan's own rules (PLAN_RULES) hold: tasks that must exist, ordering through
// blocked_by, and wording a task's body or acceptance must keep.
// This replaces coax/web/project/nostr-plan.test.ts.

// A rule a line, its fields split by '|':
//   has|SLUG                     the task exists
//   reaches|FROM|TO|yes or no    FROM waits on TO through blocked_by, at any depth
//   status|SLUG|STATE
//   body|SLUG|TEXT               the body holds TEXT
//   acceptance|SLUG|TEXT         the acceptance, its checks joined by spaces, holds TEXT
//   acceptance=|SLUG|A|B...      the acceptance is exactly A, B, ...
PLAN_RULES :: [122] string.[
  "reaches|nostr-event|schnorr-verify|yes",
  "reaches|nostr-event|schnorr-sign|no",
  "reaches|nostr-event-sign|schnorr-sign|yes",
